{
  "id": "6a8129f488da5e3b581c81fd",
  "title": "最安飯",
  "created": 1786849786,
  "updated": 1786853603,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6a8129f488da5e3b581c81fd",
      "text": "最安飯",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786849786,
      "updated": 1786849786
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8129f900000000008bab09",
      "text": "[食費]を[最安]にしたい[Summer498.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786849786,
      "updated": 1786853454
    },
    {
      "id": "6a812db000000000008bab24",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786850736,
      "updated": 1786850736
    },
    {
      "id": "6a812db000000000008bab25",
      "text": "制限",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786850736,
      "updated": 1786850912
    },
    {
      "id": "6a812e5f00000000008bab27",
      "text": "\t[健康な最低限度の栄養素]を摂取する",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786850912,
      "updated": 1786850949
    },
    {
      "id": "6a81331200000000008bab33",
      "text": "\t\t文化的じゃなくてもいい",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786852115,
      "updated": 1786852125
    },
    {
      "id": "6a812fd200000000008bab2d",
      "text": "\t生ゴミを出さない",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786851283,
      "updated": 1786851290
    },
    {
      "id": "6a812e5d00000000008bab26",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786850909,
      "updated": 1786850909
    },
    {
      "id": "6a812a0400000000008bab0b",
      "text": "[炭水化物]：塩茹で[パスタ]\t50円/100g",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786849796,
      "updated": 1786853536
    },
    {
      "id": "6a812a1800000000008bab0c",
      "text": "\t少量の水でパスタを茹でたら茹で汁が全部吸われて捨てるところ無くなった",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786849817,
      "updated": 1786849848
    },
    {
      "id": "6a812a3600000000008bab0d",
      "text": "\t\tカップ麺と同じような作り方になってきた",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786849846,
      "updated": 1786849848
    },
    {
      "id": "6a812b520000000000f99eb6",
      "text": "\t\t[ワンパンパスタ]っぽい[caki.icon]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786850130,
      "updated": 1786850209
    },
    {
      "id": "6a812a3600000000008bab0e",
      "text": "\t市販のパスタに熱湯入れて3分待ったらいい感じになる説あるかも",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786849846,
      "updated": 1786849848
    },
    {
      "id": "6a812bce00000000008bab18",
      "text": "\t塩は要る",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786850254,
      "updated": 1786850267
    },
    {
      "id": "6a812a3600000000008bab0f",
      "text": "[タンパク質]：[鶏肉]\t100円/100g",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786849846,
      "updated": 1786853517
    },
    {
      "id": "6a812d3400000000008bab1f",
      "text": "\t100g当たりのタンパク質",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786850613,
      "updated": 1786850613
    },
    {
      "id": "6a812d3400000000008bab20",
      "text": "\t\t鶏肉　＞　豚肉　＞　牛肉　＞　卵",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786850613,
      "updated": 1786851970
    },
    {
      "id": "6a812d3400000000008bab21",
      "text": "\t100g当たりの価格",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786850613,
      "updated": 1786850618
    },
    {
      "id": "6a812d3400000000008bab22",
      "text": "\t\t卵　＜　鶏肉　＜　豚肉　＜　牛肉",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786850613,
      "updated": 1786851980
    },
    {
      "id": "6a812cd500000000008bab1d",
      "text": "\t切り分けてジップロックに仕分けよう",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786850518,
      "updated": 1786850613
    },
    {
      "id": "6a812a5d00000000008bab11",
      "text": "\t\tジップロックは10個とか持っておく",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786849886,
      "updated": 1786849912
    },
    {
      "id": "6a812a7c00000000008bab12",
      "text": "[食物繊維]：[大根]・[人参]・[ゴボウ]・[蓮根]・[ひじき]\t100円/100g",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786849917,
      "updated": 1786853579
    },
    {
      "id": "6a812cb600000000008bab1c",
      "text": "\t100g当たりの食物繊維が非常に多い",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786850487,
      "updated": 1786850499
    },
    {
      "id": "6a812f5b00000000008bab28",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786851163,
      "updated": 1786851279
    },
    {
      "id": "6a812fc600000000008bab2c",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786851271,
      "updated": 1786851271
    },
    {
      "id": "6a812fb800000000008bab2a",
      "text": "光熱費は誤差",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786851257,
      "updated": 1786851686
    },
    {
      "id": "6a812fc500000000008bab2b",
      "text": "\tIH強火（約1,450〜3,000W）: 1時間で約44.9〜93.0円",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786851270,
      "updated": 1786851705
    },
    {
      "id": "6a812c2100000000008bab1b",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786850338,
      "updated": 1786850338
    },
    {
      "id": "6a812a0300000000008bab0a",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786849795,
      "updated": 1786849795
    },
    {
      "id": "6a812a8f00000000008bab14",
      "text": "豆知識",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786849936,
      "updated": 1786849943
    },
    {
      "id": "6a812a9600000000008bab16",
      "text": "\t白米の値段＋炊飯器の値段＋炊飯の手間　と　パックご飯の値段　を比較すると[パックご飯]を買う方がトータルでお得",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786849943,
      "updated": 1786853603
    },
    {
      "id": "6a812ae100000000008bab17",
      "text": "\t\t炊飯は炊き込みご飯等のアレンジをしたくなる時にメリットが生まれる",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786850018,
      "updated": 1786850115
    },
    {
      "id": "6a812a9600000000008bab15",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786849943,
      "updated": 1786849943
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8135f500000000008bab3a",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786852854,
      "updated": 1786852854
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8135e800000000008bab38",
      "text": "制約条件を見直してみるとなんだかんだ贅沢な悩みを持っているような気がしてきた[Summer498.icon]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786852840,
      "updated": 1786852890
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8135f300000000008bab39",
      "text": "\t極貧生活になると健康のラインが破られる",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786852851,
      "updated": 1786852922
    },
    {
      "id": "6a81365e00000000008bab3c",
      "text": "\t\t健康ラインを保持しつつ最安にしたいというのはある意味贅沢",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786852958,
      "updated": 1786852979
    },
    {
      "id": "6a81363900000000008bab3b",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786852922,
      "updated": 1786852922
    }
  ]
}